    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i try to breathe but it just feels like i'm suffocating in this house. it's like he took all the light with him when he left. i look at his side of the bed and it just makes me realize how much i'm just wasting time being here by myself. it's exhausting to keep pretending that things will eventually get better.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
